{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x plus 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>, where&nbsp;<math alttext=\"x greater than 9\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>9</mn></math>?</p>", "keys": ["31bd90b3-92de-4397-b2a6-4445c199f59d"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "31bd90b3-92de-4397-b2a6-4445c199f59d", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"4 plus StartFraction 37 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mn>37</mn>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "9e8187b2-c12d-4dea-b57d-0ac05647be90", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"4 plus StartFraction 35 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mn>35</mn>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "85273b59-9071-4ddf-b8e4-8b83f6b6acbb", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"4 plus StartFraction 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "e6e29ab3-2a58-41c9-8d83-6928390e1ee9", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"4 minus StartFraction 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p>Choice A is correct. The given expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x plus 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> can be rewritten as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x minus 36 plus 36 plus 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x minus 36 Over x minus 9 EndFraction plus StartFraction 37 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. Factoring <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math> from the numerator of the first fraction yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 left parenthesis x minus 9 right parenthesis Over x minus 9 EndFraction plus StartFraction 37 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x greater than 9\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>9</mn></math>, this expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 plus StartFraction 37 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x plus 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is equivalent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 plus StartFraction 37 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice B is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x minus 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 4 x plus 1 Over x minus 9 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "94498a74-a763-40c5-b248-608f7ff7f6e4", "correct_answer": ["A"]}